revenant-blood-writing-name = Blood writing
revenant-blood-writing-desc = Summons an ethereal crayon of blood to draw glyphs with. Costs essence to use.

revenant-animate-name = Animate
# Reserve edit - Animate reworked: items hover and throw themselves, several at once
revenant-animate-desc = Bring handheld objects around you to life (up to 6 within 3 tiles): they hover, glow and hurl themselves at any living being that comes close. Guns shoot on their own, handcuffs cuff people and grenades jump into pockets and arm themselves. Animated objects can't be picked up, except handcuffs and grenades, which jump into hands themselves. Using it leaves you vulnerable to attacks for a long period of time.
